  "body": "- Freehold top floor apartment\r\n- Two rare undercover car parks\r\n- Storage locker in the garage\r\n- Sunny deck with bi-fold windows\r\n\r\nPositioned on the top floor in the very centre of Long Bay Village, this light and inviting apartment offers the perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and coastal lifestyle. Filled with beautiful morning sun, the lounge, bedroom, and deck enjoy a warm, open feel that makes everyday living a pleasure.\r\n\r\nOther Features Include:\r\n- Modern kitchen \r\n- Spacious, well-proportioned bedrooms\r\n- Functional and generous bathroom\r\n- Low-maintenance, easy-care living\r\n\r\nStep out of the building and you're immediately immersed in village life, with cafes, shops, and local amenities right at your doorstep. Long Bay Beach, coastal walking tracks, and open green spaces are all within easy walking distance, making this an exceptional lifestyle location.\r\n\r\nPerfectly suited to a single professional or a younger couple, this is an opportunity to secure an easy-care home in one of Long Bay's most desirable and connected positions.\r\n\r\nNote: For clarity in marketing, the apartment is advertised as 303, reflecting the building's three-level layout; however, the legal unit designation is 603.\r\n\r\nConjunctional offers welcomed!\r\nUse this link to view property files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/EAXI",
